# Local emulator data
# data-export/ holds the production dump for emulators + prerender.
# We track only the public event snapshot (used by prerender at build time)
# so the prerender has data to work with on Netlify. Sensitive bits (auth,
# users with PII) stay ignored.
data-export/*
!data-export/firestore-export/
!data-export/firestore-export/events.json
!data-export/firestore-export/manifest.json
